===Etymology===
From {{der|en|lou|zydéco|}}, compare French [[zarico]]; possibly from a metanalysis of {{der|en|fr|les}} {{m|fr|haricots||beans}} as {{der|en|fr|le}} {{m|fr|zarico||beans}} in a dance-tune title.

